WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.137
This practice example combines several list operations in one short workflow.

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:10.067
We begin with ages twenty-three, thirty-one, and twenty-nine.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.582
Append adds forty-two.

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:19.829
Pop removes the last value, so forty-two comes back out and the list returns to the original three ages.

00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:27.021
The average of twenty-three, thirty-one, and twenty-nine is about twenty-seven point seven.

00:00:27.021 --> 00:00:31.026
Try changing the numbers or removing a different position.

00:00:31.026 --> 00:00:36.271
The goal is to become comfortable predicting how the list changes after each operation.
